raph\" ><strong>Advanced Evolution Stone (right)</strong>: Guaranteed to drop after defeating king-level monsters (those with colorful borders and are very large).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using Evolution Stones is required for enhancing, evolving, and redrawing skills, so use them wisely. Be sure to pick them up whenever you see them on your journey!</p>","developers":["Keith Ku"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312060/4d2f946c083c8d8aac80c64a0e6213c723e4e6ce/header.jpg?t=1761840035","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Sonoma 14.6.1<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 \u6216 Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Sonoma 14.6.1<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 \u6216 Intel Core M</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3312060/943530315/8c823441abe3efbf47248f237715e362475c23be/1758168215/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758169292","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3312060/943530315/8c823441abe3efbf47248f237715e362475c23be/1758168215/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758169292","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3312060/943530315/8c823441abe3efbf47248f237715e362475c23be/1758168215/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758169292","id":257200742,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257200742/movie480.mp4?t=1758169292","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2572